sequenceDiagram
    participant A as App (requests / curl)
    participant P as Corp proxy :3128
    participant S as API server :443
    A->>P: CONNECT api.example.com:443
    P-->>A: 407 Proxy Authentication Required<br/>Proxy-Authenticate: Basic realm="corp-proxy"
    A->>P: CONNECT … + Proxy-Authorization: Basic …
    P-->>A: 200 Connection established
    rect rgb(255, 243, 205)
    Note over A,S: TLS inspection: proxy terminates TLS and re-signs
    A->>P: TLS ClientHello (SNI api.example.com)
    P->>S: new TLS session to the real server
    P-->>A: cert for api.example.com issued by "Corp TLS Inspection CA"
    end
    alt Corp CA not in the app's trust store
      A--xP: CERTIFICATE_VERIFY_FAILED (SSLError / curl 60)
    else verify=corp-ca.pem / REQUESTS_CA_BUNDLE / --cacert
      A->>S: GET /api/v1/... (through the proxy)
      S-->>A: 200 OK
    end
